      "side": 1,
      "message": "Non-blocking comment.\n\nFundamentally, this re-sync step feels bolted on. As is we\u0027ve split the PPM responsibilities between pdc_power_mgmt and the PPM driver. \n\nLong term, should we consider a refactor such that the only the PPM communicates with the PDC, and the PPM has two clients - the EC with a small OPM that runs when the AP is off and the full-featured OPM run by the AP?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "c8ee150fb46ab6c4279b1c9de0addc5ed0917354",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6c7d0029_c4036dd4",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 6
